Dear Minister,

I write to notify you that Judicial Review proceedings have been issued and=
 served in the matter Zahmoul v Secretary of State for Justice & HMCTS (AC-2=
025-LON-004293).

The claim concerns systemic administrative failures within HMCTS, including=
:
=E2=80=A2 the alleged misadministration of court-controlled electronic material w=
ith potential criminal relevance, and
=E2=80=A2 failures in identifying, recording, and implementing participation meas=
ures for a vulnerable court user.

Given your responsibility for the courts system and HMCTS operational overs=
ight, this notification is provided for transparency.

Filed documents are publicly accessible here:
https://github.com/nadiazahmoul/JR-Zahmoul-v-SSJ-HMCTS-Archive

Yours faithfully,
Nadia Zahmoul

=20

